OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fshowers will become light and more
OL,7,Fconfined to the northwest though
OL,8,Fbecoming mostly cloudy. The east
OL,9,Fbecoming mainly dry with a few clear
OL,10,Fintervals.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMainly dry, though rather
OL,13,Fcloudy at times with a few light
OL,14,Fshowers. Some sunshine around too the
OL,15,Fbest along the east coast and the
OL,16,Fnortheast. Far west breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
