OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading from the northwest on
OL,7,FFriday, brightening later. Patchy rain
OL,8,Fmay return on Saturday but will die
OL,9,Fout later with Sunday looking dry and
OL,10,Fsunny.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
